{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "_doc": "#1765 Cloud Media Center > Games: a catalogue of well-known Android games by category, with the store icon, name, developer and short description of each. Served at runtime as shared/games-catalogue (same framework as store-phone-recommendations, #1749), never baked into an APK: the app fetches it from raw.githubusercontent.com with an ETag and keeps the last copy in its webview storage. `icon` is the store's own public listing image URL, loaded by the app at runtime and cached by the webview; no third-party artwork is committed or bundled. `source` is the listing store (play | fdroid); open-source games are all F-Droid. Install goes through Cloud Store when installed, otherwise the market:// (Play) or F-Droid listing intent; Open launches the installed game. Add a row to add a game; no Kotlin.",
